create_horizon is an independent, unofficial reimplementation of the gameplay of the Create mod
(https://github.com/Creators-of-Create/Create) for Horizon. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by
the Create team, Horizon, Mojang or Microsoft. "Create" belongs to The Create Team.

This repository contains no code, textures, models, sounds or translations from Create. Create's
assets are All Rights Reserved; players supply them from their own copy of the official Create jar,
which Horizon reads at run time.
